SUMMARY:TDRR #20 Weekend Short Ride\, Speedwell Forge Repose (24F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: Cathleen Anderson.
 \n\nCelebrate the Tour de France and ride our Tour de Red Rose as a tribut
 e to the event. This year you can win prizes just by RSVPing on Meetup and
  Riding our Rides!\n\nFull Details on Our TdRR Page: [LBC's Tour de Red Ro
 se Page](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257
