 =257148&module_id=340196).\n\nCue & GPX File: [Cue & GPX Files](https://ro
 utes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/wh-speedwell-forge-repose-24f/)\n\nTour de 
 Red Rose & LBC Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route C
 hanges and Weather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?h
 l=en#!forum/lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\
 n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, a
 nd basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBei
 ng a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https:
 //www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour
  RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://l
 ancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_
 id=323984) and [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver]
 (https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
