SUMMARY:Ride the Jack Markel/ Battery Park Trails 21 miles flat
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n15 folks have already sig
 ned up for this ride from the Wolverton Club.\nJoin your bicycle riding fr
 iends from the LBC Club and Wilmington Rails Trails for one of our most po
 pular rides\, a trail ride on the Industrial-Jack Markell Trail from Wilmi
 ngton to New Castle. In New Casket we will ride a couple miles up the Dela
 ware Bay on Battery Park Trail. Turning back we will ride back to Wilmingt
 on where we will stop and eat along the Riverfront at Timothy’s Riverfro
 nt Grill. There is plenty of parking in the parking lot of the DuPont Envi
 ronmental Center. This is a casual ride. Please do not go on this ride if 
 you are not willing to stay with the group and wear a helmet. No one will 
 be left behind. Like always helmets are required. Have a tube with you so 
 someone can fix your flat. This trail is paved or wooden bridges\, so any 
 kind of bicycle will do.\nRichard Conner\, Leader 717-572-8480
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3157085
 09/
